#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: getyourcash-paybylink.php:215
msgid "GetYourCash PayByLink"
msgstr "GetYourCash PayByLink"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Accept WooCommerce payments through GetYourCash PayByLink, with pre-"
"authorization, redirect and automatic status synchronization."
msgstr ""
"Gateway WooCommerce per GetYourCash PayByLink con pre-autorizzazione, "
"redirect e sincronizzazione automatica dello stato."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "IOHO SRL"
msgstr "IOHO SRL"

#: getyourcash-paybylink.php:84
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni"

#: getyourcash-paybylink.php:152
msgid "GetYourCash capture failed; order put back on hold."
msgstr "Incasso GetYourCash non riuscito; ordine rimesso in sospeso."

#: getyourcash-paybylink.php:171
msgid "Capture GetYourCash payment"
msgstr "Incassa pagamento GetYourCash"

#: getyourcash-paybylink.php:174
msgid "Check GetYourCash payment status"
msgstr "Verifica stato pagamento GetYourCash"

#: getyourcash-paybylink.php:206
msgid ""
"GetYourCash: the pre-authorization was not captured, so the customer is not "
"charged. The reserved funds are released according to the card issuer's "
"rules; contact GetYourCash to release them earlier."
msgstr ""
"GetYourCash: la pre-autorizzazione non è stata incassata, quindi al cliente "
"non viene addebitato nulla. I fondi bloccati vengono sbloccati secondo le "
"regole dell’emittente della carta; contatta GetYourCash per sbloccarli prima."

#: getyourcash-paybylink.php:216
msgid ""
"When you pay with GetYourCash, we send your name, company, billing address, "
"phone number, email address, customer ID and the order amount to GetYourCash "
"to process the payment. GetYourCash handles your payment details according "
"to its own privacy policy."
msgstr ""
"Quando paghi con GetYourCash, inviamo a GetYourCash nome, ragione sociale, "
"indirizzo di fatturazione, numero di telefono, indirizzo e-mail, ID cliente "
"e importo dell’ordine per elaborare il pagamento. GetYourCash tratta i dati "
"di pagamento secondo la propria informativa sulla privacy."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-api-client.php:46
msgid "Incomplete GetYourCash login response."
msgstr "Risposta login GetYourCash incompleta."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-api-client.php:130
msgid "GetYourCash authentication failed."
msgstr "Autenticazione GetYourCash non riuscita."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-api-client.php:148
msgid "GetYourCash API URL is not configured."
msgstr "URL API GetYourCash non configurato."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-api-client.php:195
msgid "GetYourCash API error (HTTP %d)"
msgstr "Errore API GetYourCash (HTTP %d)"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-api-client.php:212
msgid "Invalid JSON response from GetYourCash."
msgstr "Risposta JSON GetYourCash non valida."

#. translators: %s: API base URL.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-api-client.php:228
msgid ""
"%s returned a web page instead of an API response: check that it is the "
"GetYourCash API address."
msgstr ""
"%s ha restituito una pagina web invece di una risposta API: verifica che sia "
"l’indirizzo API di GetYourCash."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:25
msgid ""
"Take payments through GetYourCash PayByLink in pre-authorization mode, and "
"capture them from the WooCommerce order screen."
msgstr ""
"Pagamento tramite GetYourCash PayByLink in modalità pre-autorizzazione, con "
"incasso dalla schermata dell’ordine WooCommerce."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:33 includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:82
msgid "Pay securely with GetYourCash."
msgstr "Paga in modo sicuro tramite GetYourCash."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:37
msgid "TEST MODE: no real payment will be taken."
msgstr "MODALITÀ TEST: non verrà effettuato alcun pagamento reale."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:68
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "Abilita/Disabilita"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:70
msgid "Enable GetYourCash PayByLink"
msgstr "Abilita GetYourCash PayByLink"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:74
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Titolo"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:76
msgid "Payment method name shown to customers at checkout."
msgstr "Nome del metodo di pagamento mostrato ai clienti al checkout."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:80
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrizione"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:85
msgid "Test mode"
msgstr "Modalità test"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:87
msgid "Use the GetYourCash sandbox"
msgstr "Usa la sandbox GetYourCash"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:88
msgid ""
"In test mode, payments go to the sandbox (coretestsecure.getyourcash.eu) "
"with the sandbox credentials below, and no real money is taken."
msgstr ""
"In modalità test i pagamenti vengono inviati alla sandbox (coretestsecure."
"getyourcash.eu) con le credenziali sandbox qui sotto, senza addebiti reali."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:92
msgid "Live credentials"
msgstr "Credenziali di produzione"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:96 includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:327
msgid "API username"
msgstr "Username API"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:101
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:330
msgid "API password"
msgstr "Password API"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:106
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:333
msgid "Merchant Local Branch ID"
msgstr "Merchant Local Branch ID"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:108
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:128
msgid ""
"Save your credentials to see the list of available branches. Filled in "
"automatically when your account has only one branch."
msgstr ""
"Salva le credenziali per vedere l’elenco delle sedi disponibili. Viene "
"compilato automaticamente se il tuo account ha una sola sede."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:112
msgid "Sandbox credentials"
msgstr "Credenziali sandbox"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:116
msgid "Sandbox API username"
msgstr "Username API sandbox"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:121
msgid "Sandbox API password"
msgstr "Password API sandbox"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:126
msgid "Sandbox Merchant Local Branch ID"
msgstr "Merchant Local Branch ID sandbox"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:132
msgid "Payment options"
msgstr "Opzioni di pagamento"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:136
msgid "Link validity (minutes)"
msgstr "Validità link in minuti"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:142
msgid "Payment action"
msgstr "Azione di pagamento"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:144
msgid ""
"\"Authorize only\" reserves the funds on the customer's card and puts the "
"order On hold: the payment is captured when you confirm the order. "
"\"Authorize and capture\" charges the customer as soon as the payment is "
"authorized and sets the order to Processing."
msgstr ""
"\"Solo autorizzazione\" blocca i fondi sulla carta del cliente e mette "
"l’ordine In sospeso: il pagamento viene incassato quando confermi l’ordine. "
"\"Autorizza e incassa\" addebita il cliente appena il pagamento è "
"autorizzato e imposta l’ordine In lavorazione."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:147
msgid "Authorize only (capture later)"
msgstr "Solo autorizzazione (incasso successivo)"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:148
msgid "Authorize and capture immediately"
msgstr "Autorizza e incassa subito"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:152
msgid "Capture on status change"
msgstr "Incasso al cambio di stato"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:154
msgid "Capture the payment when the order is moved to Processing or Completed"
msgstr ""
"Incassa il pagamento quando l’ordine passa a In lavorazione o Completato"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:155
msgid ""
"Applies to \"Authorize only\". If the capture fails, the order is put back "
"On hold. You can always capture manually with the \"Capture GetYourCash "
"payment\" order action."
msgstr ""
"Vale per \"Solo autorizzazione\". Se l’incasso non riesce, l’ordine torna In "
"sospeso. Puoi sempre incassare manualmente con l’azione ordine \"Incassa "
"pagamento GetYourCash\"."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:159
msgid "Custom PayByLink"
msgstr "Custom PayByLink"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:161
msgid "Set IsUsingCustomPayByLink = true"
msgstr "Imposta IsUsingCustomPayByLink = true"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:165
msgid "RedirectAfterMs"
msgstr "RedirectAfterMs"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:167
msgid ""
"Delay in milliseconds before GetYourCash redirects the customer back to the "
"store."
msgstr ""
"Ritardo in millisecondi prima che GetYourCash reindirizzi il cliente al "
"negozio."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:171
msgid "Debug log"
msgstr "Log di debug"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:173
msgid "Log API requests"
msgstr "Registra le richieste API"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:174
msgid ""
"Logs are written to WooCommerce > Status > Logs (source \"getyourcash\"). "
"Credentials and customer data are masked."
msgstr ""
"I log sono scritti in WooCommerce > Stato > Log (sorgente \"getyourcash\"). "
"Credenziali e dati dei clienti sono mascherati."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:235
msgid "GetYourCash"
msgstr "GetYourCash"

#. translators: 1: store currency, 2: supported currencies.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:252
msgid ""
"GetYourCash is not shown at checkout because your store currency is %1$s. "
"Supported currencies: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"GetYourCash non è mostrato al checkout perché la valuta del negozio è %1$s. "
"Valute supportate: %2$s."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:274
msgid "sandbox"
msgstr "sandbox"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:274
msgid "live"
msgstr "produzione"

#. translators: 1: environment (live/sandbox), 2: error message.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:280
msgid "GetYourCash (%1$s): connection test failed. %2$s"
msgstr "GetYourCash (%1$s): test di connessione non riuscito. %2$s"

#. translators: 1: environment (live/sandbox), 2: list of branches.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:298
msgid ""
"GetYourCash (%1$s): connection OK. Available Merchant Local Branch IDs: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"GetYourCash (%1$s): connessione OK. Merchant Local Branch ID disponibili: "
"%2$s"

#. translators: %d: branch ID.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:308
msgid ""
"GetYourCash: Merchant Local Branch ID set to %d, the only branch on your "
"account."
msgstr ""
"GetYourCash: Merchant Local Branch ID impostato a %d, l’unica sede del tuo "
"account."

#. translators: %d: configured branch ID.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:314
msgid "GetYourCash: Merchant Local Branch ID %d is not one of your branches."
msgstr ""
"GetYourCash: il Merchant Local Branch ID %d non corrisponde a nessuna delle "
"tue sedi."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:315
msgid "GetYourCash: enter one of the Merchant Local Branch IDs listed above."
msgstr ""
"GetYourCash: inserisci uno dei Merchant Local Branch ID elencati sopra."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of missing settings.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:340
msgid "GetYourCash configuration is incomplete: %s."
msgstr "Configurazione GetYourCash incompleta: %s."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:350
msgid "Invalid order."
msgstr "Ordine non valido."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:358
msgid ""
"This payment method is temporarily unavailable. Please choose another "
"payment method or contact us."
msgstr ""
"Questo metodo di pagamento non è al momento disponibile. Scegli un altro "
"metodo di pagamento o contattaci."

#. translators: %s: order number.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:379
msgid "WooCommerce order #%s"
msgstr "Ordine WooCommerce #%s"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:411
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:425
msgid ""
"We could not start the GetYourCash payment. Please try again or choose "
"another payment method."
msgstr ""
"Non è stato possibile avviare il pagamento GetYourCash. Riprova o scegli un "
"altro metodo di pagamento."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:424
msgid "GetYourCash: the response did not contain a paymentLink."
msgstr "GetYourCash: paymentLink mancante nella risposta."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:437
msgid "Awaiting GetYourCash pre-authorization."
msgstr "In attesa della pre-autorizzazione GetYourCash."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:462
msgid "Your GetYourCash payment was not completed. Please try again."
msgstr "Il pagamento GetYourCash non è stato completato. Riprova."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:510
msgid "GetYourCash TransactionId is missing."
msgstr "TransactionId GetYourCash mancante."

#. translators: %s: GetYourCash payment status.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:539
msgid "GetYourCash status: %s."
msgstr "GetYourCash: stato %s."

#. translators: %s: GetYourCash payment status.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:539
msgid "not available"
msgstr "non disponibile"

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:556
msgid ""
"Immediate capture failed: the funds are still reserved. Capture the payment "
"with the \"Capture GetYourCash payment\" order action."
msgstr ""
"Incasso immediato non riuscito: i fondi restano bloccati. Incassa il "
"pagamento con l’azione ordine \"Incassa pagamento GetYourCash\"."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:563
msgid ""
"Funds are reserved: move the order to Processing or Completed to capture the "
"payment."
msgstr ""
"Fondi bloccati: sposta l’ordine in In lavorazione o Completato per incassare "
"il pagamento."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:598
msgid "This order has no GetYourCash pre-authorization to capture."
msgstr "Questo ordine non ha una pre-autorizzazione GetYourCash da incassare."

#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:604
msgid ""
"The order total is higher than the pre-authorized amount. Create a new "
"payment for the difference."
msgstr ""
"Il totale dell’ordine supera l’importo pre-autorizzato. Crea un nuovo "
"pagamento per la differenza."

#. translators: %s: error message.
#: includes/class-gyc-pbl-gateway.php:632
msgid "GetYourCash capture failed: %s"
msgstr "Incasso GetYourCash non riuscito: %s"

